# Smoke test for stockmarket. Two screenshots — same pre/post-fetch
# pattern as bilibili: the first display_stockmarket call ran with
# all-zero run_data (BEFORE the synchronous WIFI_CONN handler set the
# AAPL values), and `action UP` triggers a second process tick that
# re-renders with the parsed Yahoo fixture data (175.50 / +1.33%).

app stockmarket

wait_ms 400
screenshot 01_initial
assert_no_crash

action UP
wait_ms 400
screenshot 02_with_data
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
